(3. Step-by-Step Setup Guides) Tj
ET
BT
/F2 11 Tf
12.6499999999999986 TL
0.059 0.298 0.506 rg
42.5196850393700814 742.6774015748030706 Td
(3.1 Firebase Project Handover \(Database Only\)) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 9 Tf
10.3499999999999996 TL
0.059 0.298 0.506 rg
42.5196850393700814 725.6695275590550409 Td
(Note: Firebase is used exclusively as a database; no hosting setup is required.) Tj
T* (1. Go to console.firebase.google.com and log in.) Tj
T* (2. Open your project 'day-foundation' and go to Project settings > Users and permissions.) Tj
T* (3. Click 'Add member', enter the owner's Google email, and assign the 'Owner' role.) Tj
T* (4. Copy the Web App config keys \(API Key, App ID, etc.\) from the config screen and paste them into Vercel environment variables.) Tj
ET
BT
/F2 11 Tf
12.6499999999999986 TL
0.059 0.298 0.506 rg
42.5196850393700814 643.4648031496062686 Td
(3.2 Gmail SMTP Setup \(Automated Emails\)) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 9 Tf
10.3499999999999996 TL
0.059 0.298 0.506 rg
42.5196850393700814 626.4569291338582389 Td
(1. Log into your rawbyteproduction@gmail.com account security panel \(myaccount.google.com/security\).) Tj
T* (2. Enable 2-Step Verification.) Tj
T* (3. Search for 'App passwords', name it 'Website Email Client', and click Create.) Tj
T* (4. Copy the generated 16-digit app password and enter it in GMAIL_APP_PASS in your Vercel settings.) Tj
ET
BT
/F2 11 Tf
12.6499999999999986 TL
0.059 0.298 0.506 rg
42.5196850393700814 544.2522047244094665 Td
(3.3 Google AI Studio \(Gemini API Key\)) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 9 Tf
10.3499999999999996 TL
0.059 0.298 0.506 rg
42.5196850393700814 527.2443307086614368 Td
(1. Go to aistudio.google.com and sign in.) Tj
T* (2. Click 'Get API key' in the top-left menu.) Tj
T* (3. Click 'Create API key' and copy the resulting string \(starts with 'AQ.'\).) Tj
T* (4. Add it to VITE_GEMINI_API_KEY environment variable on Vercel.) Tj
ET
BT
/F2 11 Tf
12.6499999999999986 TL
0.059 0.298 0.506 rg
42.5196850393700814 445.0396062992125508 Td
(3.4 Razorpay Integration \(Donations\)) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 9 Tf
10.3499999999999996 TL
0.059 0.298 0.506 rg
42.5196850393700814 428.0317322834645211 Td
(1. Sign up for a business account at Razorpay.com and upload verification details.) Tj
T* (2. Once verified, go to Settings > API Keys.) Tj
T* (3. Generate a key \(choose 'Test' key for staging or 'Live' key for actual payments\).) Tj
T* (4. Copy the Key ID and paste it in VITE_RAZORPAY_KEY_ID in Vercel.) Tj
ET
BT
/F2 11 Tf
12.6499999999999986 TL
0.059 0.298 0.506 rg
42.5196850393700814 345.8270078740156919 Td
(3.5 ImgBB Cloud Integration \(Image Uploads\)) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 9 Tf
10.3499999999999996 TL
0.059 0.298 0.506 rg
42.5196850393700814 328.8191338582676053 Td
(1. Register a free account at api.imgbb.com.) Tj
T* (2. Click 'Add API Key' on the homepage.) Tj
T* (3. Copy the 32-character key and set it in VITE_IMGBB_API_KEY on Vercel.) Tj
ET
